# LICENSE is compared with ArenaMode's LICENSE when ArenaMode packages the shared Core
# (ArenaMode tools/Write-ArenaAssets.ps1). Pin it to LF so core.autocrlf=true cannot
# check it out with CRLF in a fresh clone or worktree.
LICENSE text eol=lf
# Consumers copy the interop file verbatim; pin it (and the compiled example) to LF so a copy taken
# from a Windows checkout does not differ from the master in every line.
interop/**/*.cs text eol=lf
